 dikarang.","","ngoko"],["gubal","1 gubal (antarane klika karo kayu); 2 isih prejengan, isih cêngkorongan; digubai: 1 dicêcêki kulite (êrine lsp); 2 diprèjèngi, dibakali.","","ngoko"],["gubang","tataran ing wit krambil lsp.","","ngoko"],["gubernemen","gupêrmèn.","",""],["gubernur","gupêrnur.","",""],["guci","goci.","","ngoko"],["gudang","gudhang.","","ngoko"],["gudi","dhog (kanggo ndandani prau).\n--- 64 ---","","ngoko,dialek"],["gugat","digugat: digugat; kc. adu.","","ngoko"],["guguk","gumuk, punthuk.","","ngoko"],["gugup","1 rame bangêt; 2 gugup, bingung, kêsusu bangêt.","","ngoko"],["gugur","1 gogrog, tiba; 2 kluron; digugurkan: digogrogake, diruntuhake; keguguran: kluron.","","ngoko"],["gugus(an)","1 untingan, bêngkêkan; 2 wulèn, dhompolan; 3 gêgrombolaning pulo-pulo.","","ngoko"],["guha","guwa.","","ngoko,dialek"],["guit","mengguit (-guit): kroncalan, obah-obah sikile.","","ngoko"],["gula","gula; gula batu: gula batu; gula bunga: kêkêmbangan ing roti lsp; gula hitam (-jawa): gula jawa; gula-gula, gula mutia: kêmbang gula; gula pasir: gula pasir.","","ngoko"],["gulai","gule, jangan; digulai: digule, dikêla, dijangan.","","ngoko"],["gulana","sêdhih, prihatin.","","ngoko"],["gulang-gulang","gubug ing sawah.","","ngoko"],["gulat","bergulat: gêlut, gulêt, rukêt.","",""],["guliga","uci-ucining kewan (landhak lsp) dianggo panawar wisa.","","ngoko,dialek,arab"],["guling","berguling, mengguling: ngglindhing, gumlundhung, diguling(kan): diglundhungake, diglindhingake, digulungake, terguling-guling: gêgulungan, gulung koming, kêglundhung-glundhung.","","ngoko,cakapan,arkais"],["gulita","(gelap-) pêtêng ndhêdhêt.","",""],["gulung","gulung(an); bergulung-gulung: gêgulungan; digulung: 1 digulung; 2 dikêrasi, dikêrêngi, diêlud tmr. mungsuh.","","ngoko"],["gulut","bergulut: 1 (ut. bergulut-gulut, menggulut) rêrikatan, sarwa kêsusu tmr. tumandang ing gawe; 2 balapan bantêr-bantêran.","","ngoko"],["gum","swara gumlêgêr.","","ngoko"],["gumal","pating jêkêthut, uwêl-uwêlan tmr. dl